                                <p>
                                    At FM Global, I worked as an experience
                                    design co-op focusing on information
                                    architecture and organizational research. My
                                    primary project involved
                                    "blueprinting"—documenting how information
                                    flowed across the organization to help
                                    leadership understand the system and help
                                    designers know what information needed to be
